{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/779421-scion-companion-what-s-in-it","id":779421,"title":"Scion: Companion. What's In It?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-03T18:31:27-08:00","id":779421,"title":"Scion: Companion. What's In It?","content":"So I'm curious as to what the contents are for Scion: Companion in terms of what it brings to the game. I'm aware that it adds some new pantheons and has a pre-generated story, but beyond that, I can't seem to find any information.<br /> <br /> Judging by the name of the book,my guess is that it has a larger than normal collection of antagonists, allies, guides, mentors and birthrights, but I would need somebody else to confirm this.<br /> <br /> <br /> One reason I'm planning to get the book is for the Celestial Bureaucracy, because Sun Wukong looks like a very entertaining God. But does the book function like a monster manual , or what's the deal?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T00:21:09-08:00","id":779596,"title":"","content":"It's a grab-bag. Lemme give a chapter run-down:<br /> <br /> Chapter 1: The Tuatha de Danaan and Crom Cruach, Titan of Earth.<br /> Chapter 2: Manifestation of Ichor - brief bit on creating more experienced PCs, new Knacks, new Birthrights (Creatures, Followers, Guides &amp; Relics), the Atlantean Purview Scire, new Boons for existing Purviews, and new spells for the Magic Purview.<br /> Chapter 3: The Celestial Bureaucracy and Hundun, Titan of Chaos.<br /> Chapter 4: Secrets of the World - brief bit on inter-pantheon politics, expanded Strength table, expanded throwing rules, improvised weapons, expanded weapons/armor/vehicles list, Relic weapons/armor/vehicles, antagonist group the Order of the Divine Glory, expanded material on Fatebound companions, creating pantheons, creating titanspawn, dot-costing relics, and a collection of story ideas.<br /> Chapter 5: The Devas and Vritra, Titan of Drought.<br /> Chapter 6: The World at War, alternate historical setting in World War II, with the Allied and Yankee pantheons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T03:23:54-08:00","id":779654,"title":"","content":"I see, so I was mostly right in it being an expansion material. Thank you. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-31T20:01:03-08:00","id":797619,"title":"","content":"So yeah, apparently I should have gotten Ragnarok first. Some things in Companion use Boons and stuff located in that book. Such as deities having the Frost and Illusion Purviews.<br /> <br /> Though until I get my hands on that book, I can just <a href=\"http://scion-mmp.wikidot.com/frost-boons\" target=\"_blank\">use this website.</a> Since it seems to list those Purviews.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T11:50:31-08:00","id":797901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/779421-scion-companion-what-s-in-it?p=797619#post797619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Though until I get my hands on that book, I can just <a href=\"http://scion-mmp.wikidot.com/frost-boons\" target=\"_blank\">use this website.</a> Since it seems to list those Purviews.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're probably better off <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/scionoverhaul/\" target=\"_blank\">using this site</a>, since it has better versions of <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/scionoverhaul/purviews/frost\" target=\"_blank\">Frost</a> and <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/scionoverhaul/purviews/illusion\" target=\"_blank\">Illusion</a>. Apparently they also put out some new stuff for the Tuatha de Danaan, though I haven't checked that out yet.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2447-twitchtherat","name":"TwitchTheRat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2447_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T14:16:52-08:00","id":797973,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TwitchTheRat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/779421-scion-companion-what-s-in-it?p=797901#post797901\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You're probably better off <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/scionoverhaul/\" target=\"_blank\">using this site</a>, since it has better versions of <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/scionoverhaul/purviews/frost\" target=\"_blank\">Frost</a> and <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/scionoverhaul/purviews/illusion\" target=\"_blank\">Illusion</a>. Apparently they also put out some new stuff for the Tuatha de Danaan, though I haven't checked that out yet.<br /> <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I thought that was a fan project or something. That or Scion 2.0 isn't completed yet. I'd rather not have this turn out like World of Darkness where I bought all the 1st edition books that are no longer relevant to gameplay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T15:53:26-08:00","id":798007,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/779421-scion-companion-what-s-in-it?p=797973#post797973\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I thought that was a fan project or something. That or Scion 2.0 isn't completed yet. I'd rather not have this turn out like World of Darkness where I bought all the 1st edition books that are no longer relevant to gameplay.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is 1st Edition Scion.<br /> At some point in the future there will be 2nd Edition Scion.<br /> Scion: Companion is from 1st Edition Scion, and will become obsolete.<br /> Scion: Companion has some pretty questionable stuff.<br /> You linked a fan website which is not Scion 1st Edition.<br /> I also linked a fan website which is not Scion 1st Edition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2447-twitchtherat","name":"TwitchTheRat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2447_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T00:55:13-08:00","id":801874,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/779421-scion-companion-what-s-in-it?p=797973#post797973\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> I thought that was a fan project or something. That or Scion 2.0 isn't completed yet. I'd rather not have this turn out like World of Darkness where I bought all the 1st edition books that are no longer relevant to gameplay.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> We had Scion 2.0 on our heads since the announcement of JSR shutting down. Unfortunately, it's far too close to Scion 2ed, but the name's got a bit of meaning to us so we keep it.<br /> It is completely fan-based, and focused on updating and reworking the base Scion 1ed rules, purviews, and whatnot. In our own personal games, almost every purview is completely rewritten and reworked - however, to release it to the public, there's a lot of mechanical discussion and fluff to make sure it's our best possible product.<br /> <br /> We just released War, and we revised the Tuatha - taking what was in Scion Companion and making it far more mythological accurate to the pantheon portrayed. Our next project is a complete update to the Greeks, and we're in talks with revitalizing the Kami and Shen pantheons.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/606-aynie","name":"Aynie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar606_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}